     <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Why combine architecture services with interior design?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Planning the building and the interiors together fixes window sizes, ceiling heights, electrical points and furniture early, which avoids expensive changes once construction starts.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Building That Works for Decades</h2>\n            <p>A house or office is a long-term asset. Good architecture services plan for growing families, extra floors and future repairs, not only for how the building looks on day one.</p><p>Have a plot or an old house in Hauz Khas? <a href=\"/hauzkhas/contact\">Contact 9th Corner</a> with the plot size and your plans, and we can start with a simple feasibility check.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}